  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Search field seems to allow text input longer than the limit of 20 that causes an unfriendly raw error of \"searchTerm exceeds maximum string length: ...\", while it still seems to be properly searching for the given term. Only searching for text longer than 200 prevents the search.\n\nSo in summary right now:\n\n- The input field has no text length limit.\n\n- The error in alert is shown for length of >20.\n\n- The actual length limit that prevents searching is >200.\n\n---\n\nExpected behavior:\n\nA text field length limit should be set and the error should actually enforce blocking the search and should be human friendly.",
